---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Background tests
permalink: /fons/
eleventyExcludeFromCollections: true
crumbs: [{ label: "Background tests" }]
---
{#- Test page (not linked in the menu): all the generative background variants.
    Styles live in sora.css ("Generative backgrounds"); sora.js places the circles at random. #}
<style>
  .fons .bg{min-height:440px;border-bottom:var(--rule)}
  .fons .t{position:relative;padding:calc(var(--pad)*2) var(--pad) var(--pad);font-size:clamp(44px,7vw,108px);line-height:.92;letter-spacing:-.035em;font-weight:300}
  .fons .lab{position:absolute;right:var(--pad);bottom:var(--pad);font-size:12px}
  .fons .bar{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:var(--pad);padding:var(--pad);border-bottom:var(--rule)}
  .fons .bar button{font:inherit;background:none;color:inherit;border:var(--rule);padding:8px 14px;cursor:pointer;white-space:nowrap}
  .lm{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);border-bottom:var(--rule)}
  .lm > div{border-right:var(--rule);display:flex;flex-direction:column}
  .lm > div:last-child{border-right:0}
  .lm .mock{display:flex;height:72px;border-bottom:var(--rule)}
  .lm .mock span{flex:1;display:flex;align-items:center;padding:0 var(--pad);font-size:21px;letter-spacing:-.01em}
  .lm .mock i,.lm .big i{position:relative;display:block;overflow:hidden;width:40px;border-left:var(--rule)}
  .lm .big{display:flex;gap:12px;padding:var(--pad);flex-wrap:wrap}
  .lm .big i{width:60px;height:108px;border:var(--rule)}
  .lm p{padding:0 var(--pad) var(--pad);font-size:14px;line-height:1.4}
  .lm h3{padding:var(--pad) var(--pad) 6px;font-size:14px;font-weight:400;text-transform:uppercase}
  @media (max-width:860px){.lm{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}}
  @media (max-width:860px){.fons .bg{min-height:340px}}
</style>

<section class="page-head">
  <h1 class="title">Background tests</h1>
</section>
<div class="fons">
  <div class="bar"><p><b>Logo mark.</b> Four proposals for the box next to CARLESORA: Mondrian-style straight lines with the colours of the circles. Each visit draws a new layout; top is the real size, below are three samples, larger.</p>
    <button type="button" class="caps" data-remondrian>Draw again</button></div>
  <div class="lm">
    {%- set props = [
      ["m1", "1 — One colour cell", "Black lines cut the box into rectangles; one cell is coral."],
      ["m2", "2 — Three warm cells (logo)", "Two or three lines, at most three columns and three rows; up to three cells in coral, orange and peach."],
      ["m3", "3 — Coloured lines", "No fills: the lines themselves are coral and orange, a little thicker."],
      ["m4", "4 — Grid over circles", "Two small overlapping discs under the black grid, echoing the backgrounds."]
    ] %}
    {%- for pr in props %}
    <div>
      <div class="mock"><span>CARLESORA</span><i><svg class="lines" data-mondrian="{{ pr[0] }}" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"></svg></i></div>
      <h3>{{ pr[1] }}</h3><p>{{ pr[2] }}</p>
      <div class="big">{% for k in range(3) %}<i><svg class="lines" data-mondrian="{{ pr[0] }}" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"></svg></i>{% endfor %}</div>
    </div>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
  <div class="bar"><p>Every visit draws new circles. B is the one on the home page; the others are kept for later.</p>
    <button type="button" class="caps" data-regen=".fons [data-gen]">Draw again</button></div>
  {%- set title %}<h2 class="t">Digital design,<br>new narratives<br>&amp; creative tech.</h2>{% endset %}
  {%- set circles %}<span class="c c1"></span><span class="c c2"></span>{% endset %}

  <section class="bg b" data-gen>{{ circles | safe }}{{ title | safe }}<span class="lab caps">B — Warm, soft (home)</span></section>
  <section class="bg a" data-gen>{{ circles | safe }}{{ title | safe }}<span class="lab caps">A — Warm, full</span></section>
  <section class="bg cbw" data-gen>{{ circles | safe }}{{ title | safe }}<span class="lab caps">C — Black &amp; white</span></section>
  <section class="bg d" data-gen>
    <svg class="gen" aria-hidden="true">
      <defs><clipPath id="clipD"><circle/></clipPath></defs>
      <circle class="lens" clip-path="url(#clipD)"/><circle class="ca"/><circle class="cb"/>
    </svg>{{ title | safe }}<span class="lab caps">D — Lines + warm overlap</span></section>
  <section class="bg e" data-gen>{{ circles | safe }}{{ title | safe }}<span class="lab caps">E — Dark</span></section>
  <section class="bg f" data-gen>{{ circles | safe }}{{ title | safe }}<span class="lab caps">F — Small accent</span></section>
</div>
